Package: gpcs
Title: Grant Proposal Creation System (R implementation)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Darrell A.", "Hall", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dah512@edmhs.us")
Description: Parses funding solicitations, applies standard federal application package
    structures (SF424 R&R, SF-424), builds nonprofit/for-profit applicant profiles and a
    compliance crosswalk. Mirrors the Python gpcs package for redundancy.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: yaml, jsonlite
Suggests: pdftools, plumber, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
